---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import musculacionImage from "../assets/musculacion.webp";
import crossfitImage from "../assets/crossfit.jpg";
import bodybuilderImage from "../assets/bodybuilder.jpg";
---

<section id="servicios" class="text-center px-4 py-16 md:mx-8">
  <h1 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-primary mb-7">Servicios</h1>
  <div class="flex flex-col gap-6 md:flex-row justify-between lg:text-left">
    <div
      class="card-container flex-grow cursor-pointer flex flex-col items-center min-w-[200px] max-w-[400px]"
    >
      <div class="card--flipper w-full aspect-[3/4]">
        <div
          class="flex flex-col side side--a bg-[var(--color-button)] overflow-hidden"
        >
          <Image
            src={musculacionImage}
            class="w-full h-full object-cover"
            alt="Musculación"
          />
          <p
            class="mt-2 text-center text-lg font-bold text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-100"
          >
            Musculación
          </p>
        </div>
        <div
          class="side side--b flex flex-col items-center justify-center bg-[var(--color-button)] text-white rounded-2xl"
        >
          <p
            class="px-4 ext-2xl md:text-3xl text-text-offset leading-relaxed font-bold"
          >
            Desarrollo de fuerza y resistencia mediante cargas progresivas.
            Ideal para tonificar, ganar masa muscular y mejorar la postura.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div
      class="card-container flex-grow cursor-pointer flex flex-col items-center min-w-[200px] max-w-[400px]"
    >
      <div class="card--flipper w-full aspect-[3/4]">
        <div
          class="flex flex-col side side--a bg-[var(--color-button)] overflow-hidden"
        >
          <Image
            src={crossfitImage}
            class="w-full h-full object-cover"
            alt="@tjegan"
          />
          <p
            class="mt-2 text-center text-lg font-bold text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-100"
          >
            Crossfit
          </p>
        </div>
        <div
          class="side side--b flex flex-col items-center justify-center bg-[var(--color-button)] text-white rounded-2xl"
        >
          <p
            class="px-4 ext-2xl md:text-3xl text-text-offset leading-relaxed font-bold"
          >
            Disciplina orientada a la estética muscular: simetría, definición y
            proporción. Se combinan entrenamiento intenso y dieta controlada
            para esculpir el cuerpo.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div
      class="card-container flex-grow cursor-pointer flex flex-col items-center min-w-[200px] max-w-[400px]"
    >
      <div class="card--flipper w-full aspect-[3/4]">
        <div
          class="flex flex-col side side--a bg-[var(--color-button)] overflow-hidden"
        >
          <Image
            src={bodybuilderImage}
            class="w-full h-full object-cover"
            alt="@otrouser"
          />
          <p
            class="mt-2 text-center text-lg font-bold text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-100"
          >
            BodyBuilder
          </p>
        </div>
        <div
          class="side side--b flex flex-col items-center justify-center bg-[var(--color-button)] text-white rounded-2xl"
        >
          <p
            class="px-4 text-2xl md:text-3xl text-text-offset leading-relaxed font-bold"
          >
            Entrenamiento funcional, variado e intenso que combina fuerza,
            agilidad y resistencia. Se realiza en comunidad con ejercicios
            desafiantes y medidos por WODs.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
  document.querySelectorAll(".card-container").forEach((card) => {
    card.addEventListener("click", () => {
      card.classList.toggle("flip");
    });
  });
</script>

<style>
  .card--flipper {
    position: relative;
    height: 100%;
    width: 100%;
    transform-style: preserve-3d;
    transition: transform 0.8s;
  }
  .card-container.flip .card--flipper {
    transform: rotateY(180deg);
  }
  .side {
    backface-visibility: hidden;
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: 1rem; /* coincide con la imagen */
  }
  .side p {
    margin: 0;
  }
  .side--a {
    transform: rotateY(0deg);
    z-index: 2;
  }
  .side--b {
    transform: rotateY(180deg);
  }
</style>
